# Goal definition
float32 target_height # Target height relative to takeoff point (positive value expected, e.g., 5.0 for 5 meters up)
float32 takeoff_velocity # Optional: Desired vertical velocity (m/s, positive up) - default if not provided
---
# Result definition
bool success
string message
float32 final_height # Actual height reached (relative to takeoff point)
---
# Feedback definition
float32 current_height # Current height relative to takeoff point
float32 height_remaining # Estimated height remaining to target
